  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming NCD Care through Health System Strengthening in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lao PDR faces a rising burden of NCDs, yet service coverage, data systems, strategic planning, financing and governance to tackle the issues remain limited. This project proposes an integrated strategy to scale up PHC-based NCD care, establish a DHIS2-based surveillance system, and develop a costed multisectoral action plan supported by youth-led behavior change. It contributes to UHC and SDG 3.4 by strengthening equity, participation, and accountability. This project prioritizes adults over 40</narrative>
  </description>
